cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use LaraIoT-App in your research, thesis, or benchmarking projects, please cite it as follows."
type: software
title: "LaraIoT-App: Containerized Reference and Benchmarking Platform for the LaraIoT Framework"
abstract: >-
  LaraIoT-App is the containerized reference and template application designed
  to demonstrate, evaluate, and benchmark the LaraIoT (danpopa/laraiot) framework.
  It provides an out-of-the-box, fully reproducible Docker-based testbed integrating
  MQTT communication, relational state persistence with MariaDB, live event
  broadcasting via Laravel Reverb WebSockets, background ingestion workers, and an
  Inertia.js/Vue 3 single-page dashboard. The platform enables comparative
  latency and performance analysis between Polling and WebSocket paradigms in
  controlled IoT environments.
repository-code: "https://github.com/danielpopa26/laraiot-app"
url: "https://github.com/danielpopa26/laraiot-app"
license: MIT
keywords:
